WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.792 --> 00:00:12.696
It's true that an updo, which exposes the neckline, suits hanbok best for an elegant, refined look — and about 90% of wedding parents choose one.

2
00:00:13.032 --> 00:00:21.960
That's because hanbok is such a voluminous garment that the hair needs matching volume and dimension to balance the whole look.

3
00:00:22.296 --> 00:00:25.608
But an updo isn't an absolute rule.

4
00:00:25.944 --> 00:00:31.632
If you always wear a short cut, or feel an updo just doesn't suit you,

5
00:00:31.968 --> 00:00:38.304
you can style your short hair elegantly to match the hanbok's dignity instead of forcing it up.

6
00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:47.040
The key isn't whether it's an updo, but whether it harmonizes with the hanbok's volume — work with your artist to find the image that suits you best.
